    tax_old_regime: Math.round(tax_old),
    tax_savings: Math.round(diff),
    recommended_regime: recommended,
    guidance: `Old Regime tax calculated assuming common deductions of 2,25,000 INR (including 50k Standard Deduction, 1.5L 80C, and 25k 80D). New Regime tax includes 75,000 INR Standard Deduction. The ${recommended} is more tax efficient by ${Math.round(diff)} INR.`
